<title>UK: NOMURA LEADS $450 MLN ONE-YEAR NOTE FOR UKRAINE.</title>
<headline>NOMURA LEADS $450 MLN ONE-YEAR NOTE FOR UKRAINE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following note was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Nomura.</p>
<p>BORROWER **UKRAINE FIDUCIARY ISSUE BY BANKERS TRUST LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> AMT    $450 MLN	COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    12.AUG.98</p>
<p> TYPE   FIDUCIARY     ISS PRICE  91.80     PAY DATE    11.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    91.30     SPREAD     *+325 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10	  LISTING    LUX	 SALE LIMS US/UK/JP/LU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 MGT/UND    0.85	SELL CONC   0.15</p>
<p> NOTES    **ISSUED BY UKRAINE ACTING THROUGH BANKERS TRUST</p>
<p>	     *OVER LIBOR</p>
<p>		THE DEAL IS SECURED ON A LOAN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
